sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant Consumer as EmployeeConsumer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Match as MatchingEngine
    participant Projection as EffectiveRoleProjection
    participant Redis as Redis

    Kafka->>Consumer: Employee attribute changed
    Consumer->>DB: Update employee projection

    Consumer->>Match: evaluateMembership()

    Match->>DB: Read relevant User Groups
    DB-->>Match: Candidate Groups

    Match->>Match: Employee no longer matches

    Match->>DB: Remove membership
    Match->>Projection: recompute effective access

    Projection->>DB: Resolve Roles from remaining memberships
    DB-->>Projection: Remaining grants

    Projection->>DB: Update effective Roles
    Projection->>Redis: Replace user authz cache
